From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:41:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/65] Port all 99 module initialisations from the assembly

Every init called by H000+$0000 is now C. Constant tables are generated
from the asm and applied by init_data.c; loops are hand-written. Each
module's data is verified byte for byte against scripts/emu68k_init.py.
The program now runs until the first unported callee of main, H006+$01AE.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
